WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Use Copilot safely. Prompt clearly. Refine the result. Review before sharing.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Prompt clearly. Use Goal, Context, Source and Expectation. Tell Copilot what success looks like.

00:10.000 --> 00:17.000
A stronger prompt names the goal, audience, approved source and required format.

00:17.000 --> 00:22.000
Refine the result. Ask for a shorter version, a decision focus or a rewrite for a different audience.

00:22.000 --> 00:28.000
Review before sharing. Verify accuracy, audience fit, data handling and readiness. You own the final judgment.

00:28.000 --> 00:34.000
When unsure, pause. Do not include sensitive or restricted information until you confirm it is permitted.
